<title>POLAND: TENNIS-TARANGO WINS POLISH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TARANGO WINS POLISH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>POZNAN, Poland 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final at the men's $125,000 Polish Open tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p> Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat David Rikl (Czech Republic)   7-5 6-3.</p>
</text>
